fields.description:
The {{loginwith}} string introduced in [https://moodle.atlassian.net/browse/MDL-87546|https://moodle.atlassian.net/browse/MDL-87546|smart-link] is currently defined as {{'Log in with'}}, which is designed to be concatenated with a provider name in the UI (e.g. "Log in with Google"). This violates [Moodle's coding style policy|https://moodledev.io/general/development/policies/codingstyle#strings], which states that language strings must be able to stand alone and should not be designed for UI concatenation, as this causes difficulties when translating into other languages.

The string should be updated to accept the provider name as a placeholder instead, e.g.: {{$string['loginwith'] = 'Log in with {$a}';}}

This way the full sentence is self-contained and translatable as a unit.
